   987	  low-slack, stronger-moderate signature isolated by stmap26. In stmap28, that
   988	  hard blocker is replaced by a soft area-margin penalty on high-reference
   989	  moderate seeds whose slack and arrival-gain ratios resemble load-risky
   990	  choices. In stmap29, the high-reference penalty is made continuous over the
   991	  same seed band. In stmap30, the same load-risk surface is extended to
   992	  high-reference strong deep seeds with a smaller continuous penalty. In
   993	  stmap31, the strong-seed gain slope is damped to probe the penalty threshold.
   994	  In stmap32, a cut-leaf load proxy adds a candidate-cut fanout-shape term to
   995	  the strong-seed penalty. In stmap33, the cut-leaf term is normalized by the
   996	  selected supergate fanout limit to test a library-derived drive/load signal.]
   997	
   998	  SideEffects []
   999	
  1000	  SeeAlso     []
  1001	
  1002	***********************************************************************/
